title: MeasurementsQuest1
tags:
---
<< if DoesHeKnow("Measurement1") >>
	You already took this measurement.
<<elseif DoesHeKnow("Measurement1") && DoesHeKnow("Measurement2") && DoesHeKnow("Measurement3")>>
	You already know all the measurements, better return to DR. AALDENBURG.
<<else>>
	NARRATOR: The radio static is louder and clearer here than ever before. You can make up words, yet they sound mixed up.
	NARRATOR: This spot must be what Dr. Aaldenburg was talking about. One of those measurement spots.
	->( Take out the GPS)
		(SASHA takes out the GPS)
		NARRATOR: You take the GPS out of your pocket, and turn it on. After a few seconds, the screen comes to live. Two numbers, with an obscene amount of decimals are shown on it. This must be the coordinates.

	-> (Note down the numbers and put the GPS away.)
		(SASHA notes down the coordinates)
	<<Learn Measurement1>>
<<endif>>
